B.Qe=new A.bt("bld_corn",B.ak,"Bu\u011fday Tarlas\u0131 (Tar\u0131m)","Wheat Farm (Agriculture)","Temel g\u0131da kayna\u011f\u0131. Hasat edilen bu\u011fday do\u011frudan t\xfcketilebilir veya De\u011firmende una d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcr\xfcl\xfcr.","Primary food source. Harvested wheat can be consumed directly or milled into flour.","Bu\u011fday Tarlas\u0131, ka\u011fanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n en temel besin dire\u011fidir. \xc7ay\u0131r arazilerine kurulur. Saniyede 0.42 G\u0131da \xfcretir. \xdcretilen bu\u011fday do\u011frudan ambar\u0131 besler veya Yel De\u011firmenine sevk edilerek una \xe7evrilir. Yaz mevsiminde \xfcretimi %50 artar.","Wheat Farm is the bedrock of sustenance. Built on Meadow hexes, producing 0.42 Food/sec. Boosted by 50% in summer.",B.Rf,B.b9,"SV.1 | \xc7AYIR",B.a0h,B.B,B.B,B.WA,B.TK,B.XY)
