B.Ve=s(["Sa\u011fdaki mor Diyar Se\xe7imi butonuna dokunun.","Kazanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z Tamga miktar\u0131n\u0131 ve Kurgan miras\u0131n\u0131 inceleyin.","G\xd6\xc7\xdc BA\u015eLAT butonuna basarak yeni topraklarda daha g\xfc\xe7l\xfc bir ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 yap\u0131n."],t.s)
